#passage(("In your Quran, that you instantly and clearly say is not corrupted, in your Book, in the Quran that you believe is the speech of Allah, why is there not even one single verse that talks about the most important creed that the whole religion of yours is based on? You are called \"Shi'a 12 Imamiya\". You're called the follower of the 12 Imams. You're called جعفريّة (Ja'fariya: named after Ja'far asSadiq). So this is the whole creed; this is your whole religion.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Shia Girl Confronts Muslim On His Claims Then This Happens! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LcbjBQElXe0", ((792, "13:12–13:38"),))
