#passage(("You call upon someone who is dead; there are other groups that do this. Why is the problem with calling upon someone who's dead? It's associating with Allah, and we explained before why it's associating with Allah, and we gave verses of the Quran. Allah says: and who is more misguided, the one who calls upon someone who's not going to respond to him until the day of judgment; he's unaware of your Dua, and when the resurrection and Gathering happens they will be your enemy and they will deny your worship. So calling upon someone who's dead, who cannot hear you and help you, is what? Worship, with the testimony of the Quran. Allah, he says: call upon me and I will answer you; those who refrain from My Worship. So he say call upon me, and he called it worship. Prophet, he said: to make Dua is worship. So they call upon people who cannot hear them, who cannot benefit them, who cannot help them in need. We say to them: that's problematic based on the Quran.", "You don't like companions, but the Quran is there refuting you. The companions of the prophet: Allah praised them and he promised them [Jannah] in the Quran clearly. Allah says in [verse] 100: the first [forerunners], and those who follow them in righteousness, Allah is pleased with them and they are pleased with him, and he prepared for them Gardens which [rivers flow] beneath. Allah says also: Those Who migrated before the [Hijrah] and after, Allah promised them all. So this is how Allah speaks about the Companions and tells us to follow them, and you curse them.", "Prophet, he said: do not curse my companions. [By] the one who has the soul of prophet [Muhammad] sallu alaihi wasallam in his hand, by Allah, if one of you spends like the mountain in Gold, it will not be equal to the [mudd], which is like the handful, or half of it. You will give a mountain of gold; if they were to give a handful or half of it, it will not be equal to it, because of their virtue. They are one of the reasons why, with the will of Allah, all of us are Muslims here today. If they didn't do their [dawah], no one here would be Muslims; no countries will have accepted Islam. They Carried the torch of Islam, and they are the one who delivered the message.", "And the wives of the Prophet: if I curse any of your wives sitting down here, is this cursing you or just your wife? That's why, if you say his wives were all [disbelieving] evil women, you are cursing him, because you're saying his companions, who he took as his company, are the worst of the creation. Not only that, you're saying Allah chose for him the worst of women and the worst of companions. Does that make any sense? Allah will choose for the prophet Muhammad, the best of Adam, the best of the humans, he will choose for him a group of evil disbelieving Companions and evil wives? According to them, that makes sense in their mind. For us, we say: if you attack someone's company and you attack their family, then you're attacking them. And this is the indirect truth of the claims of these people.", "And then you have groups, extreme, extreme: they do actual worship of Ali, they worship their leaders, actual worship. These are worse than the Jews; they are more disbelievers than the Jews. No doubt about them. You have them in Syria, and you have some in India and other parts of the world as well, and they are complete disbelievers with the agreement of the scholars; there's no disagreement on this issue. So these are the main beliefs. The [Shia] believe other things, of course, and they have other problems in their Creed.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Aqeedah (Creed) And Its Significance In Islam | AIM Conference 2024 NJ | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULnwXbVf_cM", ((8520, "2:22:00–2:23:11"), (8595, "2:23:15–2:24:07"), (8647, "2:24:07–2:25:06"), (8706, "2:25:06–2:26:09"), (8769, "2:26:09–2:27:02"),))
