#passage(("Third thing is cursing the Companions, saying that they're disbelievers and all of that. Is that how the Quran refers to the Companions of the Prophet? Does the Quran in any verse say that all of the Companions are disbelievers, evil people and enemies? Is there any verse like this? I'll be nice now and say: what do you guys have as evidence? Nothing! They bring one verse (atTawba9:101): (and from the surroundings of the people of Medina, there are hypocrites). We say: Ok, this verse is referring that there are hypocrites, and there were hypocrites, And Allah revealed to Hudhayfa Ibn alYaman the names of the hypocrites. We agree that there were hypocrites: There were people who're pretending to be believers who were not. But they're not the Muhajireen and Ansar, because the verse before (atTawba9:101), it is referring to them. We wouldn't say one verse says that the Muhajireen and Ansar will have Jannah And then they are منافقون (hypocrites) in the next verse! That makes zero sense. So that means whoever those hypocrites are, they're not included. They're not the Muhajireen and Ansar, Because the Muhajireen and Ansar are already promised Jannah. They bring this verse, by the way, and it's in the first few verses in Surat atTawba, so you can read it. So I'm being very honest and fair: I'll bring their evidence.", "Who said Abu Bakr and 'Umar are not from the Muhajireen and Ansar? They are! The main ones they have problems with are from the Muhajireen and Ansar: Abu Bakr and 'Umar, they're holding all of this hatred against them, they are from the Muhajireen and Ansar. So they cannot escape the fact that this verse is praising them. So there is no leeway for them there at all. Are there any other verses that we can bring from their side? There isn't.", "So there is no following Ahl alBayt in the Quran, which is the creed of the Shi'a. The second creed of the Shi'a is to do with the 12 Imams: nowhere visible in the Quran, Nowhere in the Quran that they pretend is God's words, that they say they follow (and when they recite, they make mistakes, but this is a different story). So that's another thing that is not in the Quran: to view the Companions as all disbelievers, And warn the Prophet from them and warn the believers from them.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim Fully Dismantles The Shia Position! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t7vhKiTrvNA", ((1062, "17:42–19:01"), (1160, "19:20–19:45"), (1188, "19:48–20:23"),))
