#refbox("Reference text: Quran 9:101, quran.com (Saheeh International)", (("9:101", "And among those around you of the bedouins are hypocrites, and [also] from the people of Madīnah. They have persisted in hypocrisy. You, [O Muḥammad], do not know them, [but] We know them. We will punish them twice [in this world]; then they will be returned to a great punishment."),))
