#passage(("Now, I forgot to mention one thing, which is the wife of the Prophetﷺ. How does Allah talk about the wives? If I criticize someone's wife, I criticize THEM! That's how it works. When you curse the wife of someone, you're indirectly attacking them. Now, they will talk about the Prophet: The Prophet had disbelieving wives. Allah mentioned those exceptions. How did Allah speak about the wives of the Prophetﷺ? is the question! Allah says in the Quran (alAhzab33:28): He gave them a choice between choosing Allah and His Messenger Or choosing the worldly life. And they chose Allah and His Messenger. (If you want this life and it's adornment, then say to me and I'll let you go) Meaning I'll divorce you and you can go. If you want Allah and His Messenger, then you will remain. Did they remain or not? They remained! Which means they chose Allah and His Messenger. And Allah says they are the Mothers of all the Believers (alAhzab33:6) (His wives are their mothers.) So Allahﷻ said that they chose the Afterlife, They chose the Messenger of Allah. They chose Allah, and they are our Mothers, And then you get someone who's calling them this and calling that!", "This is what I want you to understand: Forget now what they say to you about specific details, Because these specific details will have responses. I can give you some of the responses, but we'll spend our time talking about specific details, which are neither here nor there. Is the foundation defendable or not? is the question.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim Fully Dismantles The Shia Position! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t7vhKiTrvNA", ((2531, "42:11–43:35"), (2620, "43:40–43:57"),))
