#passage(("The people who opened all of the lands, including the land you come from, when you speak in the Arabic language, was the Sahaba. It's not a single country that Shia has opened. Shia can ONLY fight other Muslims, because the whole religion is based upon Hadith of the Thaqalain حديث الثقلين, Ghadeer Khom غدير خم, all.. The whole religion is just about this. The whole religion is built upon a criticism of Ahlu asSunnah. That's why Shia do not call non-Muslims to Islam. Why they don't call? Because they have nothing to tell them. They're going to go to the non-Muslim and be like, \"Look, Hussain was killed in Karbala\", and they're going to be like, \"Who's Hussain?\" \"'Ali Ibn Abi Talib, the Khilafah has been taken away from him.\" He's going to be like, \"Sorry, but who's 'Ali Ibn Abi Talib, and who's Abu Bakr again?\"", "What are you going to present as evidence from the Shia tradition? Shia tradition only, so nothing that is unique between Sunni and Shia, but only the Shia tradition, exclusive. What is it that you're going to show to present that Shiism is true? We can do that from the Sunni tradition only. You can never come and claim the books of Ahlu-sSunnah, Hadith, are lies and whatever, and they are full of prophecies of the future of the Prophet Muhammadﷺ. I can only use that; that on its own I can use as evidence to prove Islam is right, just from the books of Ahlu-sSunnah.", "You literally said you go to the Shia scholar to ask him about Shiism, and he goes to our books. So they can tell you: Oh, look, Ahlu-sSunnah, they have the same thing, so you have to believe it. Why can't they tell you: Look, here is the evidence from our books? Do you know why they can't? Because these books that they have do not have evidence for us.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Shia Follower Gets An Unexpected Reality Check! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6v8T06xoukk", ((963, "16:03–16:48"), (1015, "16:55–17:53"), (1117, "18:37–19:00"),))

