#passage(("Misguidance is many, many groups of misguidance, and each of them you will have a long time talking about them if you want to go into detail of what they did, what they didn't do. The main reason we want to give the brief overview is that when you see that name, you hear that name, you have red bells going on. And I will tell you an advice: anytime you hear a name other than Muslim should have red bells in general: okay, what's going on here? Tell us more about this.", "We have other terms of the people of the truth: the people of the Sunnah, everyone believes in the Sunnah; the group of the Muslims; the people of Hadith are the people who believe in Hadith. All of these terms, no one is going to hear and be like, something is going on here, because we all have to believe in these things. But you start hearing strange names: where's these names coming from? The minute you hear these names, and someone calling himself something in relation to these names that you've not heard, you're like, okay, something is going on here. Always be aware.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Aqeedah (Creed) And Its Significance In Islam | AIM Conference 2024 NJ | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULnwXbVf_cM", ((6779, "1:52:59–1:53:30"), (6815, "1:53:35–1:54:20"),))
