#passage(("A Muslim is someone who follows the tradition of the prophet Muhammad, peace be upon him, the hadith of the prophet, his tradition and his sunnah, and someone who follows the Quran.", "Now if you want to know the issues that some Shia believe, the overwhelming majority of them, I have a very important video on my channel. I'm talking to this lady who's a Shia from a very scholarly Shia family. She was watching the videos, she was realizing it's not true, and they were all debating with her. So she was someone who's knowledgeable. She spoke with people of knowledge and she spoke with me on the stream. Alhamdulillah, she accepted Islam. She left [Shiism], because there are misguided [sects] in Shiaism who worship other than Allah, call upon dead people like Ali: like you have people call upon Jesus, they call upon Ali. So that's not what the Quran teaches us to do.", "What I do in that video is, I show you all the creeds of [Shiism], the beliefs that they believe that are problematic, and then I give evidences from the Quran only, from the Quran mostly. Why? Because they believe in the same Quran. They may reject some of the hadith, but they accept the Quran. So I'll say, both of you, we believe in the Quran. Okay, you believe this, but it's not in the Quran. You believe that, and the Quran refutes it. So I show the creeds that they believe in and I show how the Quran refutes these ideas.", "So Shiaism is not orthodox Islam. A Muslim is someone who is a Muslim upon what the prophet believe. [Shiism] is mainly about the lineage of the prophet and people who came from that lineage, and there's 12 people and they're infallible, and follow them, and call upon [dead] people for help: things which are not teachings of Islam, that developed later on, did not come with the prophet. There was no such thing as a [Shia]. When they say they are the group of Ali, a group of a person who's a cousin of prophet Muhammad, but [the prophet had] other cousins. We're not a group of any man. We are the submitters to God. That's what a Muslim is, and the followers of the messengers of God, like Prophet Muhammad.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Lady Grills Muslim With Questions Then A Surprise Happens! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JOpckbnPmsM", ((3785, "1:03:05–1:03:13"), (3793, "1:03:13–1:04:02"), (3846, "1:04:06–1:04:35"), (3878, "1:04:38–1:05:22"),))

=== 45.7 Sunni-Shia unity
// NODE P11.C04.S07
#author("The Muslim Lantern")
